{
  "title": "Zesty Crumbly Algerian Almond Tagine",
  "description": "A light and flavorful Algerian dish featuring fresh basil and crunchy almonds, perfect for a low-carb diet. This recipe is easy to make and packed with nutrients.",
  "cuisine": "Algerian",
  "diet": [
